1. DEFINITIONS
----------------------------------------------------------------------

"Work" means the BrowsAI software, including source code, object code,
build scripts, configuration, and accompanying documentation distributed
under this license.

"You" means each individual or legal entity exercising permissions under
this license.

"Internal Use" means use of the Work by You, or by Your employees,
contractors, and authorised agents, solely for Your own internal business
or organisational operations, including internal research, internal
automation, internal product evaluation, internal quality assurance, and
similar activities that are not directed at providing the Work, or a
function materially derived from the Work, to any third party as part
of a paid or otherwise commercially-monetised offering.

"External Commercial Use" means any use of the Work that is not Internal
Use, including:

  a. selling, reselling, sublicensing, or otherwise commercially
     distributing the Work, or a derivative work of the Work, to a third
     party;
  b. embedding, bundling, or integrating the Work, or a derivative work
     of the Work, into a commercial product or service offered to a
     third party;
  c. operating the Work, or a derivative work of the Work, as a hosted,
     managed, software-as-a-service, platform-as-a-service, or
     application-programming-interface offering for third-party
     customers, whether or not a fee is charged;
  d. using the Work, or a derivative work of the Work, as a material
     functional component of a customer-facing paid offering; or
  e. providing consulting, integration, or other services to a third
     party where the Work itself, or a material function derived from
     the Work, is delivered to the third party as part of that service.

"Derivative Work" means any work that includes, depends on, or is
derived from the Work, in any form.

