3. CONDITIONS
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Any exercise of rights granted under section 2 is conditional on:

  a. preserving all copyright notices, licence texts, and required
     attribution notices accompanying the Work or any copy You receive
     or distribute;
  b. providing a copy of this licence (and any accompanying
     `LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md`) with each copy of the Work or
     Derivative Work You distribute; and
  c. not removing, obscuring, or altering any notice regarding the
     commercial-use boundary in any distributed copy.

