5. PATENTS
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Each copyright holder grants You a worldwide, royalty-free,
non-exclusive licence under the patent claims it has the right to
grant, to make, have made, use, sell, offer for sale, and import the
Work, solely for the purposes of Internal Use. This patent grant does
not extend to any External Commercial Use; for External Commercial Use
You must obtain a separate commercial licence that may include a
patent licence from the copyright holders.

If You initiate patent litigation (including a cross-claim or
counterclaim in a lawsuit) alleging that the Work constitutes direct
or contributory patent infringement, the patent licences granted to
You under this licence terminate as of the date such litigation is
filed.

