6. TERMINATION
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This licence and the rights granted to You hereunder terminate
automatically if You breach any of its conditions. Upon termination,
You must cease all use, copying, modification, and distribution of the
Work and any Derivative Works. Sections 7, 8, and 9 survive any
termination.

If You cure the breach within thirty (30) days of becoming aware of
it, the licence is reinstated for the cured portion, provided You have
not previously had this licence terminated for the same or a similar
breach.

